<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>Climate Services Dashboard | Climate Hazards Center - UC Santa Barbara</title>
  <style>
    /* --- General Styling --- */
    body {
      font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      color: #333;
    }

    h1, h2 {
      color: #003660;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #003660;
    }

    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* --- Header --- */
    .header {
      background-color: #003660;
      color: white;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .header table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      background-color: #003660;
    }

    .header a {
      color: white;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* --- Page Container --- */
    .container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    /* --- Section Cards --- */
    .section {
      background-color: white;
      border-left: 6px solid #059AB5;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      padding: 25px 30px;
    }

    .section h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #003660;
    }

    .section p {
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .section a {
      color: #003660;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
	/* --- Map Layout --- */
    .map-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .map-panel {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .map-title {
      font-size: 1em;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .legend {
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    footer {
      background-color: #003660;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
 <!-- ====== Header ====== -->
  <div class="header">
    <table>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding-left: 15px;">
          <a href="https://chc.ucsb.edu">
            <img src="CHC_logo_white.png"
              alt="Climate Hazards Center - UC Santa Barbara" style="width: 175px; height: 105px;" />
          </a>
        </td>
        <td style="text-align: right; padding-right: 20px;">
          <a href="http://www.ucsb.edu">University of California,<br>Santa Barbara</a>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" style="text-align: center;">
          <a href="https://chc.ucsb.edu/about">About</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          <a href="https://chc.ucsb.edu/people">People</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          <a href="https://chc.ucsb.edu/research">Publications</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          <a href="https://chc.ucsb.edu/tools">Tools</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          <a href="https://chc.ucsb.edu/data">Data Sets</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          <a href="https://chc.ucsb.edu/monitoring">Monitoring & Forecasting</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          <a href="https://chc.ucsb.edu/news">News</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          <a href="https://chc.ucsb.edu/activities">Activities</a>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
<!-- Section 2: Snippets -->
<div class="section">
  <h2>Snippets</h2>
  <p>
    Snippets provide a free and publicly accessible way to display maps from the Climate Hazards Center <a href="https://chc.ucsb.edu/tools/ewx">Early Warning eXplorer (EWX)</a> online application directly into your own webpage. The CHC maintains extensive data stores that are regularly updated. Snippets allow National Meteorological and Hydrological Services, humanitarian organizations, and other partners to display CHC's regularly updated datasets on their websites, improving access to actionable early warning information.</p>
<p>Examples of embedded EWX snippets are shown below. </p>
<!-- Snippet Maps -->
<div class="map-row">
  <div class="map-panel">
    <div class="map-title">CHIRPS-GEFS 5-day Rainfall Forecast</div>
    <div id="map-forecast-data"></div>
    <img class="legend" src="https://chc-ewx3.chc.ucsb.edu/images/legends/precip_monthly_data_raster.png" />
  </div>

  <div class="map-panel">
    <div class="map-title">CHIRPS-GEFS 5-day Rainfall Forecast Anomaly</div>
    <div id="map-forecast-anomaly"></div>
    <img
      class="legend"
      src="https://chc-ewx3.chc.ucsb.edu/images/legends/precip_monthly_anom_raster.png"
      alt="Monthly Rainfall Anomaly Legend"
    />
  </div>
</div>

</div>


<!-- ==========================================
     Create CHIRPS Snippets
     ========================================== -->

<script src="./snippet.js"></script>

                <script type="text/javascript">
                  new Snippet({
                    ewxUrl: 'https://ewx3.chc.ucsb.edu/ewx',
                    id: 'map-forecast-data',
                    dataset: 'CHIRPS3GEFS',
                    subDataset: 'chirps3_gefs',
                    region: 'global',
					showGaul20080: true,
                    showGaul20081: true,
                    showGaul20082: true,
                    showKenyaWards: false,
                    periodicity: '1-day',
                    forecastPeriod: '05day',
                    period: 'latest',
                    showDekadControl: true,
                    showYearControl: true,
                    units: 'mm',
                    statistic: 'data',
                    width: 300,
                    height: 350,
                    time: '2021-10-01',
                    zoom: 5.5,
                    center: [0.3, 37.4],
                  });
                </script>

                <script type="text/javascript">
                  new Snippet({
                    ewxUrl: 'https://ewx3.chc.ucsb.edu/ewx',
                    id: 'map-forecast-anomaly',
                    dataset: 'CHIRPS3GEFS',
                    subDataset: 'chirps3_gefs',
                    region: 'global',
					showGaul20080: true,
                    showGaul20081: true,
                    showGaul20082: true,
                    showKenyaWards: false,
                    periodicity: '1-day',
                    forecastPeriod: '05day',
                    period: 'latest',
                    showDekadControl: true,
                    showYearControl: true,
                    units: 'mm',
                    statistic: 'anom',
                    width: 300,
                    height: 350,
                    time: '2021-10-01',
                    zoom: 5.5,
                    center: [0.3, 37.4],
                  });
                </script>
</html>
<div class="section">
  <h2>Snippet Configurator</h2>
<p> The Snippet Configurator interface provides a tool for customizing and generating interactive maps that can be embedded directly into a webpage. The configurators allow users to customize map settings, preview the resulting map, and generate the HTML code needed to embed the map on a website. </p> <p> Below are examples of the <a href="https://climateservices.chc.ucsb.edu/configurator/chirps_config.html">CHIRPS</a> and <a href="https://climateservices.chc.ucsb.edu/configurator/chirps-gefs_config.html">CHIRPS-GEFS</a> Snippet Configurators. </p>
</div>
